<title>USA: IES Industries forms partnership in China.</title>
<headline>IES Industries forms partnership in China.</headline>
<dateline>CEDAR RAPIDS, Iowa 1997-02-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>IES Industries Inc said Thursday it formed a joint partnership with the Jiaxing City Power Bureau of Jiaxing City, China.</p>
<p>IES Industries said the partnership's first project will be running a 36-megawatt, coal-fired cogeneration facility in Jiaxing City, one of the fastest growing industrial areas in China.</p>
<p>The company said its initial investment represents about $13 million.</p>
<p>IES Industrues operates energy plants throughout Iowa.</p>
<p>Its shares were unchanged Thursday afternoon at 30-1/2.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
